    <string name="fuel_confirm_title">Turn on petrol stations?</string>
    <string name="fuel_confirm_body">What is requested: one price file for each fuel you choose (nothing until you choose some).\n\nTo which server: %1$s.\n\nWhat that server sees: your IP address and which fuels you download. Your location is never sent: the files are national and are filtered on your phone.\n\nIt connects only when you turn this on, press Update now, or open the app with data older than the update frequency.</string>
